  "details": "1. Scroll the window while dragging an object to the edge.  Including a noodle end especially.  Currently you can wheel-scroll with a noodle end, but then it won't \"take\" when you drop it, even though it looks like it is snapping to something.\n2. If you have copied some nodes, you should be able to click an area of the graph and then hit paste, and the nodes should paste where you clicked.\n3. Make it clearer when an item or noodle is selected--I have many times now thought I'd selected a noodle to delete, and deleted a node or group of nodes instead. Brighter highlights maybe.\n4. Layers of nodes/sub boxes for grouping.\n5.  ....add more in comments?",
